#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Classical gates {#classical-gates}"
msgstr "gate classici {#classical-gates}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "**NOT Gate**\n"
msgstr "**gate NOT**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The NOT gate, also known as the Pauli X gate, flips the $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ state to $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$, and vice versa. The NOT gate is equivalent to RX for the angle $\\pi$ or to ‘HZH’.\n"
msgstr "Il gate NOT, noto anche come gate Pauli X, inverte lo stato $\\left|0\\right\\rangle$ in $\\left|1\\right\\rangle$ e viceversa. Il gate NOT è equivalente a RX per l'angolo $\\pi$, oppure a 'HZH'.\n"

