msgstr "**gate T**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The T gate is equivalent to RZ for the angle $\\pi/4$. Fault-tolerant quantum computers will compile all quantum programs down to just the T gate and its inverse, as well as the Clifford gates.\n"
msgstr "Il gate T è equivalente a RZ per l'angolo $\\pi/4$. I computer quantistici fault-tolerant compileranno tutti i programmi quantistici riducendoli al solo gate T e al suo inverso, oltre ai gate di Clifford.\n"

